    "enUS": {
      "description": "I am ready to perform the ritual to summon Cyclonian.  When he is summoned, you must defeat him and take his whirlwind heart.  This I will use to instill a weapon with Cyclonian's power.\n\n{name}, are you ready to face the wind lord?",
